# Joint auxiliary/clock readiness: bounded constructive result

The derivation gives a conditional finite-control preparation theorem for S=A union X on the fixed accessible-pair geometry. It resets arbitrary correlated auxiliary and original-clock inputs into one supplied pure-memory ray, then prepares any specified normalized computable one-excitation clock packet. Every original nonclock factor experiences its actual H0 aging; all displaced information and the entire reservoir remain in the output. This is a proposed source-exposed theorem with explicit control/isolation suppliers, not retained status or native initialization.

The exact local synthesis uses a certified nonzero target amplitude as the final vertex of a cyclic NN path. Positive two-qubit logarithms deposit complex amplitudes while transporting a real tail norm; they remain well-defined at zero target amplitudes. A paid excitation pulse and final onsite phase complete the packet. The proof includes every endpoint phase, full-qubit positivity and computability without a zero-equality oracle. Full SWAP access, including its ZZ term, and the complex hopping/onsite control combinations are stated and priced as supplied resources.

The compensated object is the complete F=K_X+Delta L+sqrt(Delta)V+C0+retained reserve. H0 is not canceled. During the plateau the original clock and simulator addition are exactly canceled by positive local cI-h controls. Finite turn-on uses the full-space norm B>=||F||, and finite release uses the exact prepared norm Gamma>=||F J_ready||. On arbitrary D/S/reference inputs and independent pure memory, the full-output trace allowance is

    eta_ready + B r_on + Gamma r_off + 2 integral ||E_impl(t)|| dt.

In the literal source specialization, let T_X=K_X+sum S_j n_j, B_D=(S0+R0)I-sum d_i Pe_i, mu=<T_X>_psi and chi=sum q_i^2+sum |z_ij|^2|psi_j|^2. Then

    Gamma^2=||B_D+mu I||^2+Var_psi(T_X)+Delta chi.

Thus the K_X/S_X anticommutator and both families of source-square terms are retained. Endpoint energy mean/variance also retain the H0/B_D covariance on the actually aged nonclock state. The full Pauli scalar, local compensation dictionary, pulse action/strength/slew, timing, coefficient errors, nominal work variation and fault-work limits are explicit in DERIVATION.md. No per-sector norm is used for uncontrolled leakage.

One new memory ray of length |S| at the upper-right component-2 corner is fresh throughout the stated parameter family. It is an alternative to the preceding routed packet's three-ray resource layout. It has exactly one new unwanted adjacency to the outer z=3 cycle. The complete isolation definition includes every occupied NN pair touching S/E, including preexisting same-component chords and intercomponent edges. A static unwanted coupling is either included in the compensated baseline or charged as a full-space residual. Returning to an actual K_base with fixed residual couplings is distinguished from falsely claiming return to nominal K; positivity, energy moments and later composition carry the corresponding costs.

